{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41953","headline":"书郭判官幽斋壁 · 李中","name":"书郭判官幽斋壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不妨公退尚清虚，剏得幽斋兴有余。\n要引好风清户牖，旋栽新竹满庭除。\n倾壶待客花开後，煮茗留僧月上初。\n更有野情堪爱处，石牀苔藓似匡庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}